### Structural components

#### Steps for procedures
<Steps>
<Step title="Get API credentials">
  Sign up at [Sandbox Dashboard](https://dashboard.sandbox.co.in) to get your API key.

  <Check>
  Verify you can see your API key in the dashboard.
  </Check>
</Step>

<Step title="Set up authentication">
  Include your API key in the request headers.

  ```bash
  curl -H 'Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY' \
       -H 'x-api-key: YOUR_API_KEY' \
       https://api.sandbox.co.in/ping
  ```

  <Warning>
  Never expose your API key in client-side code or version control.
  </Warning>
</Step>
</Steps>

